<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Theorems</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Reveal GRPO as Contrastive</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Details of Sec. <a href="#S3" title="3 Bridging GRPO and DPO with Contrastive Learning ‣ It Takes Two: Your GRPO Is Secretly DPO" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.</h6>
<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">In the RLVR setting, rewards are binary, which leads to binary advantages given a prompt.
Let <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A^{+}_{q},A^{-}_{q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A^{+}_{q},A^{-}_{q}</annotation></semantics></math> denote the positive and negative advantage, respectively.
From Eq. (<a href="#S2.E6" title="In Group Relative Policy Optimization (GRPO) ( , ): ‣ 2 Preliminary ‣ It Takes Two: Your GRPO Is Secretly DPO" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>), we can have</span></p>
<table id="A1.E20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E20X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle A^{+}_{q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle A^{+}_{q}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{1-\hat{p}_{q}}{\sqrt{\hat{p}_{q}(1-\hat{p}_{q})}}=\sqrt{\frac{1-\hat{p}_{q}}{\hat{p}_{q}}}\;," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>q</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>q</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow><mo lspace="0.280em">,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{1-\hat{p}_{q}}{\sqrt{\hat{p}_{q}(1-\hat{p}_{q})}}=\sqrt{\frac{1-\hat{p}_{q}}{\hat{p}_{q}}}\;,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="2" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(20)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E20Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle A^{-}_{q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle A^{-}_{q}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E20Xa.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{0-\hat{p}_{q}}{\sqrt{\hat{p}_{q}(1-\hat{p}_{q})}}=-\sqrt{\frac{\hat{p}_{q}}{1-\hat{p}_{q}}}\;." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>q</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><msqrt><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>q</mi></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></msqrt></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{0-\hat{p}_{q}}{\sqrt{\hat{p}_{q}(1-\hat{p}_{q})}}=-\sqrt{\frac{\hat{p}_{q}}{1-\hat{p}_{q}}}\;.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">In Eq. (<a href="#S2.E5" title="In Group Relative Policy Optimization (GRPO) ( , ): ‣ 2 Preliminary ‣ It Takes Two: Your GRPO Is Secretly DPO" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>), the clipping function can be considered as applying an indicator function to the token,
which does not affect trajectory-level behavior.
The omission of the clipping function does not affect the analysis, as the out of range will lead to zero gradient.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text">The key derivation is as follows:</span></p>
<table id="A1.E21" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A1.E21X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E21X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathcal{J}_{\text{GRPO}}(\theta)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒥</mi><mtext>GRPO</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathcal{J}_{\text{GRPO}}(\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="6" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(21)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E21Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E21Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{\begin{subarray}{c}q\sim\mathcal{Q}\\
o_{i}\sim\pi_{\theta_{\text{old}}}(\cdot|q)\end{subarray}}\frac{1}{G}\sum_{i=1}^{G}\frac{1}{|o_{i}|}\sum_{t=1}^{|o_{i}|}\frac{\pi_{\theta}(o_{i,t}|o_{i,&lt;t},q)}{\pi_{\theta_{\text{old}}}(o_{i,t}|o_{i,&lt;t},q)}A_{i,t}\;," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi>o</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>G</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mtext>old</mtext></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{\begin{subarray}{c}q\sim\mathcal{Q}\\
o_{i}\sim\pi_{\theta_{\text{old}}}(\cdot|q)\end{subarray}}\frac{1}{G}\sum_{i=1}^{G}\frac{1}{|o_{i}|}\sum_{t=1}^{|o_{i}|}\frac{\pi_{\theta}(o_{i,t}|o_{i,&lt;t},q)}{\pi_{\theta_{\text{old}}}(o_{i,t}|o_{i,&lt;t},q)}A_{i,t}\;,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E21Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E21Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{\begin{subarray}{c}q\sim\mathcal{Q}\\
o_{i}\sim\pi_{\theta}(\cdot|q)\end{subarray}}\frac{1}{G}\sum_{i=1}^{G}\frac{1}{|o_{i}|}\sum_{t=1}^{|o_{i}|}\pi_{\theta}(o_{i,t}|o_{i,&lt;t},q)A_{i,t}\;," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi>o</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>G</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>G</mi></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{\begin{subarray}{c}q\sim\mathcal{Q}\\
o_{i}\sim\pi_{\theta}(\cdot|q)\end{subarray}}\frac{1}{G}\sum_{i=1}^{G}\frac{1}{|o_{i}|}\sum_{t=1}^{|o_{i}|}\pi_{\theta}(o_{i,t}|o_{i,&lt;t},q)A_{i,t}\;,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.E21Xc" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E21Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{\begin{subarray}{c}q\sim\mathcal{Q}\\
o_{j}\sim\pi_{\theta}^{+}(\cdot|q)\\
o_{k}\sim\pi_{\theta}^{-}(\cdot|q)\end{subarray}}\frac{1}{G}\left(\sum_{j=1}^{G^{+}}\frac{1}{|o_{j}|}\sum_{t=1}^{|o_{j}|}A_{j}^{+}\pi_{\theta}(o_{j,t}|o_{j,&lt;t},q)+\sum_{k=1}^{G^{-}}\frac{1}{|o_{k}|}\sum_{t=1}^{|o_{k}|}A_{k}^{-}\pi_{\theta}(o_{k,t}|o_{k,&lt;t},q)\right)\;," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝔼</mi><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi>o</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><mi>o</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∼</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo></msup><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo fence="false" rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>G</mi></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>G</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mrow><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.280em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\mathbb{E}_{\begin{subarray}{c}q\sim\mathcal{Q}\\
o_{j}\sim\pi_{\theta}^{+}(\cdot|q)\\
o_{k}\sim\pi_{\theta}^{-}(\cdot|q)\end{subarray}}\frac{1}{G}\left(\sum_{j=1}^{G^{+}}\frac{1}{|o_{j}|}\sum_{t=1}^{|o_{j}|}A_{j}^{+}\pi_{\theta}(o_{j,t}|o_{j,&lt;t},q)+\sum_{k=1}^{G^{-}}\frac{1}{|o_{k}|}\sum_{t=1}^{|o_{k}|}A_{k}^{-}\pi_{\theta}(o_{k,t}|o_{k,&lt;t},q)\right)\;,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
